CONTEXT Preview IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Preview
{+ An INCLUDE statement with an alias can set preprocessor variables for the included file.
With the variable `Migrating`, the desired system comes without its new invariant,
so that this context may hold an atom of A that is paired with no B. +}

INCLUDE "../contexts/kurk_desired.adl" AS new --# [ "Migrating" ]

POPULATION new.A CONTAINS [ "a1" ]

ENDCONTEXT
